{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "1bb348ef19437ebe9a99faaeb445e7ffbaf82c39a49a60f2c4c3224c11bc7fb9", "ja": "アイアイッ！アイアイッ！☆お友達", "zh": "啊咿！啊咿！☆好朋友", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4afd39358a33d0a72c2e751b807201b0bbd700e92cac27eb7cdb1bb8102ff78b", "ja": "迷った三人の前に、ゴリラが現れる。一緒に\n『ジャングル☆パーティー』を踊ると、他の\n動物も現れ、みんなと友達になる。道を教え\nてもらった一行は真と出会い、お宝をかけた\nセクシー勝負をして、真美が勝利した。", "zh": "正当三人迷路时，大猩猩出现在他们面前，\n并一同跳起『丛林☆派对』，\n其他动物也纷纷现身，跟探险队成为朋友。\n从大猩猩那里得知方向的一行人遇见了真，\n双方赌上宝物较量性感，最后由真美获胜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e8e8bf847276506642f9ca94aaf8699f21bbee775421eb463d3bf3211a3a9d24", "ja": "（まみたま探検隊は、ジャングルをウンババウッホッホ\nと探検中だ。だが、困ったことに……）", "zh": "（真美阿环探险队正在丛林里嗯吧吧呜吼吼地探险中。\n不过，现在遇到了一点小麻烦……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "c68fcfc6017a933296071a7d9c4ae9fe4e82f5ec1ecfcd2a6a660f11bf499f33", "ja": "あれっ？　おやぶん、この道、\nさっきも通んなかった？", "zh": "咦？老大，\n这条路刚刚是不是走过了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8507eb81af99878679d26ed02c83003bba495b74c938940ca609adae955e12a2", "ja": "この木に結んだヒモは……。\n間違いない。さっき、俺達がつけた目印だ。", "zh": "这棵树上绑的绳子……\n没错，是我们刚刚做的记号。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7c5d714607d026d42d730012b316acae4bb59f06ac5ffae4800369957bc379c2", "ja": "どうやら俺達は、同じところを\nグルグル回っていたみたいだな……。", "zh": "我们似乎一直在同样的地方打转……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "b6cacc13c1c64454db264fabc68653ea8be91902dc435996ecf0d9bbc8da9802", "ja": "それってつまり、真美たちが\n迷子になってたってこと！？", "zh": "这也就是说，\n真美我们迷路了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1e947e7a4626f2ef1d5cc508b215b1343e58d5554c916460a91240ff665ec70e", "ja": "どうも、そうらしい。\nうーん、どうしたものか……。", "zh": "看来是这样没错。\n嗯──该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "545dd9b7415f8467eebeae2585443d4d02afd49fe358a4c3c605abdeadf4799a", "ja": "うあうあ～！　ずっと歩きっぱなしで、\n真美、お腹すいたよ～！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～！一直走一直走，\n真美都肚子饿了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "2ccf2104d261e0d90973e3ebf9d80572a9eac216716bfc880eb1c02c4f78f6e3", "ja": "たまきもお腹すいたぞ～……。\nあっ、あっちの木に、バナナが生えてる！", "zh": "环也肚子饿了喔～\n啊，那边的树上有香蕉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "7212f3d4b72fe962a3c2e34cc60cc11400dc6321831367d00e4d6c0cbc437e07", "ja": "おお、ホントだ！　たまきち隊員グッジョブ！\nメッチャおいしそ～！", "zh": "哦哦，真的耶！阿环队员Good Job！\n看起来超好吃的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "a4bf3ba37a18e10229c183aeb1a2ebef8bd2063865762fcbdba048dffc82cfc4", "ja": "たまきが取ってきてあげるね！\nちょっと待ってて、まみ、おやぶん！", "zh": "环去摘香蕉来给你们喔！\n真美跟老大稍等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "b8fd0b94b525141269496481dd4e18d1f222096b2b6a4b248dec1b4304d33012", "ja": "は～ん……♪\nジャングルのバナナは、メチャウマでしたなぁ♪", "zh": "呼……♪\n丛林里的香蕉超级好吃的耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "086016aedf758e9de3d8ac2458702e1efe21ba593a5ff21c9b4e01de53577400", "ja": "ああ、おいしかったな。\nバナナ取ってくれてありがとう、環。", "zh": "是啊，很美味呢。\n环，谢谢你帮忙摘香蕉过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "8dcfd40b6ba71664ed77f1de15dfae70e57e698aa26e1ecae7a6ff5cc3fe5cdc", "ja": "くふふ♪　バナナ食べたら、\nたまき、元気でてきたぞ！", "zh": "呵呵♪吃完香蕉后，\n环又充满活力了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "61c58fd19402df0c33f839ea24a36163b861793a946ccedebcea69eb49eb7805", "ja": "頑張って、もっと先に進もうよ、おやぶん！", "zh": "环我们努力继续前进好不好？老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cc9e7314dacde110b8b2828071b8104dee598f782c3648ddedc12308d31b06c6", "ja": "そうだな。でも、むやみに歩いても、\nまた迷子になるだけだ。", "zh": "也好，不过要是盲目乱跑，\n只会继续迷路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8c384f7e14b10bcafb467b2bab847d67833bf5cdb0f32ceb330f5cc19aa10642", "ja": "この辺りは、似たような景色が続いてるせいだろう。\n前に進むには、何か対策を考えないと……。", "zh": "问题就出在这附近的景色全都差不多吧。\n要继续前进必须先想好对策……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1016_se", "source_sha256": "14c468c82099cb5a701b0e8229c722719a6ca26f0e37f00f015878f3d89eae31", "ja": "ガサガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b8759ae49385c8bd641bcf2b16e5c22c811d2323cb9a5672cf5b462e9952296d", "ja": "ん？　何の音だ？", "zh": "嗯？这是什么声音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1018_gorira", "source_sha256": "1a8956137c8d0226c608e93d4f7f32dbd9044ac1422565c3e5f3fb0784a16a78", "ja": "ウホホ～！", "zh": "呜吼吼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "64412d6f4250dbc4066b52aa0b224bece8f49d25590f79fc4bab814e3d0edc64", "ja": "あっ、ゴリラの声だ！", "zh": "啊，是大猩猩的声音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "06cbcafaa1c433878b4a32f4fade486d912a8a90200ca797b322142cf218960f", "ja": "兄ちゃん！　となりの茂み！", "zh": "大哥哥！你看旁边的树丛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1021_se", "source_sha256": "2489c70140bbc735133bf670aa7195dc4d361d1ff3b1528069412e06af2b224b", "ja": "ガサガサーッ！", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1022_gorira", "source_sha256": "30f29d1253322be7315254cdd70b7737f9ef8f0c5d6f5e4cb88ac07096d3815e", "ja": "ウホッホ～！", "zh": "呜吼吼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "af8002d2c3e273c1bb25924dd1525b69292466284c85e4afac10923a9ef56cb6", "ja": "うわっ！　や、野生のゴリラが飛び出してきたのか！？\nふ……二人とも、あんまり刺激するなよ？", "zh": "唔哇！野、野生的大猩猩从里面跳出来了！？\n你……你们两个可别太刺激牠喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c06beb3ee8fc219c14d5418ba3bab266aaebb600a94c8391afb80fb8e0367314", "ja": "安心しろ、お前達のことは俺が必ず守る！\nいざとなったらオトリになってでも……！", "zh": "尽管放心，我一定会保护你们！\n如果真有万一，我就算当诱饵也要……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "1287b901e490c3d9f0e66b426dc9c14f86f282f0f5498bcb733e414d27ab92cd", "ja": "そんなことより兄ちゃん！\nゴリラっち、何か様子がおかしいよ？", "zh": "这个不重要，大哥哥！\n阿猩看起来好像怪怪的耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1026_gorira", "source_sha256": "62eb346c9fd2728fa61eba5177033b563b4dc8057acb84667251ba51e8c82b1d", "ja": "ウホ～……。", "zh": "呜吼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "bf42dfbd5e691162fbb31516cf96197c31e4574cf14a9929bb8abc46e9ba9d27", "ja": "そんなことって何だ……ん？\n確かにゴリラが、悲しそうな顔をしてるような……？", "zh": "哪里不重要了……嗯？\n真的耶，大猩猩看起来好像一脸伤心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "b14a98fc2f8b528141bde9bcd825851feb1ff8ec4a7e338a276bdef9946af81b", "ja": "ひょっとして、お腹すいてるの？\nこのバナナ食べてもいいよ、ゴリ子！", "zh": "难不成是肚子饿了吗？\n猩猩子，这根香蕉给你吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1029_gorira", "source_sha256": "cfbbab3bb8e46a0d767fa0b9ccc4fb06f681d6aaccb61f3f9b663c6659954eab", "ja": "ウホホ、ウホホ♪", "zh": "呜吼吼、呜吼吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b5e51c0b4bac86d8f356b850e0dd78e33278ab47b8a7491072eee43c6aedd0a2", "ja": "おお、喜んでるみたいだな……。", "zh": "哦哦，牠看起来很开心呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1031_gorira", "source_sha256": "abe113f2171a64a0710f29982b694cb04e199ae2877e39f338a431961eabbbec", "ja": "ウッホホ！", "zh": "呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "442b1f956558c7c4c318de66df553ac6c44daf646429b4fb62f28dad868e7e4d", "ja": "えっ、この木の実くれるの！？\nやったー！　大切にするね、ゴリ子！", "zh": "咦，这个树果是要给环的吗！？\n太棒了──！环会珍惜它的，猩猩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "3c34efbff668caffb8af88fea61c64e3bb5a126749701f9202a3c68b7f30291b", "ja": "くふふ、たまき達、\nゴリ子と友達になっちゃった！", "zh": "呵呵，\n环我们跟猩猩子成为朋友了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "689f50c1fd9838fad04ba1fffff7f778b91ecf113a439017d8092303dda515d8", "ja": "そんじゃあ友情の証に、\nみんなであの曲、踊っちゃおっか！", "zh": "那么作为友情的证明，\n大家就一起来跳那首歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "343478649dbced99bc1f1635fdb4dd6eae8b77ec11b53759dd3f209bd7311be8", "ja": "な、なんだ！？\nどこからか曲が流れて……！？", "zh": "怎、怎么回事！？\n音乐是从哪传过来的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "ee750271ff3b4a92bd4691062b1f41d79a9c9dbf519ec9c636a83d7749233695", "ja": "ウンババー！", "zh": "嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
