{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1039_hebi", "source_sha256": "3e94ef88bcaf56a8ca6921f30004e84cc423b6ba295e73735de73d2426231327", "ja": "シャー♪", "zh": "嘶──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1040_saru", "source_sha256": "1fdf2f2c61b26977f6624df1729a9461300a8dc5cd33c4b5fb14ed569470f648", "ja": "ウッキッキー♪", "zh": "吱吱──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1041_zou", "source_sha256": "99c1aad4a869039756009d3897250382981bc10cf898ef1e494b1556c33e23a7", "ja": "パオーン♪", "zh": "叭──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "23fd2f42f3855adc482f619effc26364c8527912927d2a0ebd2523c0e94ef26f", "ja": "って、いつの間にかヘビやサル、それにゾウまでが\n踊りに加わっている！　これは一体……？", "zh": "呃，怎么一回过神来，蛇、猴子，\n还有大象都跑来跳舞了！这究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a009f44fb2997e43a433b33cbdf3a50cad577cea02ab87c41d8b43e0b4e818ad", "ja": "（まさかこの曲……『ジャングル☆パーティー』に、\nなにか不思議なチカラが宿っているのか？）", "zh": "（难不成……『丛林☆派对』这首歌里，\n藏着什么不可思议的力量吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1044_012mam", "source_sha256": "1e7c6d94a6e8c269a43ea16bc79cc8e0c1b3e4840d7d96358669f732259f527e", "ja": "みんなと踊るの楽しかった～！\nジャングルの動物って、めっちゃノリいいよね！", "zh": "跟大家一起跳舞好开心喔～！\n丛林里的动物都超级热情的耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1045_gorira", "source_sha256": "cfbbab3bb8e46a0d767fa0b9ccc4fb06f681d6aaccb61f3f9b663c6659954eab", "ja": "ウホホ、ウホホ♪", "zh": "呜吼吼、呜吼吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "e235f847750f3bc46bb5f6a012cd2dd19a74e9adecbe6517f7c9ce869ef0da68", "ja": "うん？　ゴリラが、どこかを指さしてる。……あ、\nもしかして、次の行き場所を教えてくれているのか？", "zh": "嗯？大猩猩指着某个方向……\n啊，难不成是在告诉我们接下来该往哪走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1047_040tam", "source_sha256": "5e123004d3a42a27f63b58a3205b97ab4b06f1b7b08bcf03ccf608c54467c1a3", "ja": "ありがとー、ゴリ子！　また、みんなと\n一緒に遊ぼうね！　たまきとの約束だぞ！", "zh": "谢谢你，猩猩子！\n下次大家再一起玩吧！跟环说好了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "3fcfe2a0f8b4ccd6a5d1f20b19675fd311c3eb07bffa3c20a83390505a2f267b", "ja": "くふふ♪　『ジャングル☆パーティー』って、\nみんなと友達になれる歌なのかも！", "zh": "呵呵♪『丛林☆派对』这首歌\n说不定能让大家变成好朋友呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "907c76d69a509bf2d644434eccca4abd0884aa919e2258c74b883fb385778804", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。\nでも、いったいどうしてそんなチカラが……。", "zh": "可能是吧。\n不过，究竟为什么会有这种力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1050_012mam", "source_sha256": "d59b7b0709a4b0ad395cb8f85ac58f930e09ff5302ffa4a99577434cc47b38fc", "ja": "あれっ、あそこにいるのって、\nまこちんじゃない！？", "zh": "咦，\n那边那个人不是阿真吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1051_p", "source_sha256": "58bd82d3d1d4a8caddd6a866b248c68a07fb936f28bf9af5d5fba97829b9405a", "ja": "え、今度は真が？", "zh": "咦，这次换真了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1052_006mak", "source_sha256": "f87cc89f4b833c7deb4a7ba756cf0007b31efb1634c66905f060da2b00e2dd23", "ja": "{$P$}！　それに真美に環も！\nみんな、ジャングルのお宝を探しに来たんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}！还有真美跟环也在啊！\n大家是来丛林里寻宝的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1053_p", "source_sha256": "434498f12152834ca584181c0096b1f11a5faaab4064a81ad11eba67bbb11967", "ja": "ああ、お宝を探してるのは真美と環だけど……。\nというか、真もなのか？", "zh": "嗯，虽然只有真美跟环在找就是了……\n话说回来，真也是来寻宝的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1054_006mak", "source_sha256": "7f3d50bec86373e4e26d6335fcbf2b46dcc89455fc8e4e0c5212ca0816c0767b", "ja": "はいっ！　ボクはお宝を手に入れて、\n世界一プリティなお姫様になりたいんです！", "zh": "是的！在下想得到宝物，\n成为世界第一漂亮的公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1055_006mak", "source_sha256": "77310cad759b3fb259a5331210275f33fd492945f50d70e66e1628ce651353e0", "ja": "だから、真美と環にジャマされるわけにはいかない！\n二人とも、ボクと勝負しろ！", "zh": "所以可不能让真美跟环出手阻挠！\n你们跟在下一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1056_006mak", "source_sha256": "37a46c3e3d49ec803f0fa906ec4161f69052cee8f4c5d0bc5f060437b78172d0", "ja": "そしてボクに負けたら、\nあきらめてジャングルから帰るんだ！", "zh": "然后如果在下输了，\n就会放弃寻宝离开丛林！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1057_p", "source_sha256": "06d5e35070140ff48796bac22665c99a6cd001386b62258b9e553c8620dfa134", "ja": "（できるものなら全員帰したいんだが……）", "zh": "（可以的话我想让所有人都回去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1058_012mam", "source_sha256": "bedf83d448ac43c7c768e078c84482efd22bc8da8f924ca3f63736a907977331", "ja": "望むところだよ～！\nそんで、何して勝負すんの、まこちん？", "zh": "真美正有此意～！\n那阿真，真美我们要比什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1059_006mak", "source_sha256": "c8c8a2056096b06b5ef38644dc61c4ad6c134bd3ed9f00d232c4169c68dfc465", "ja": "そうだな……ボクの目的はプリティなお姫様。\n可愛さ対決なんて、どうかな？", "zh": "这个嘛……在下的目标是成为漂亮的公主。\n那就来比谁比较可爱怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1060_012mam", "source_sha256": "322e08b6ca3339a2ddcbbba07c5037ee88dde0d0bd6144ec4cf25573f75382ac", "ja": "んっふっふ～。若いね、若すぎるねまこちん！\nお姫様に必要なのは、可愛さだと思うの？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～太嫩了，你还太嫩了阿真！\n你觉得可爱是公主的必要条件吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1061_012mam", "source_sha256": "5bf86ea50cbb49a69c6b2369a7a1551cd1b0957693d9333a1bffdc66ef51ec38", "ja": "お姫様に必要なのはズバリ！\n王子様を一撃で落とす、せくしーだよ！", "zh": "其实公主需要的特质！\n是能够一击攻陷王子的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1062_006mak", "source_sha256": "ebc289eebaac8a937e10cbdd7e3a54033b7cf046d4e4005ade654ee7c75e22b4", "ja": "た、確かに……！\nフッ。でもいいのかい、真美？", "zh": "有、有道理……！\n呵，不过这样好吗，真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1063_006mak", "source_sha256": "ffbcfe1aa66e12c40d783677002a2a3a720c34c3bec830b1266404a61e72305b", "ja": "こうみえてボクは、このみ師匠の弟子だ！\nセクシーには、かなり自信があるよ！", "zh": "别看在下这样，在下可是木实师父的徒弟！\n对性感是相当有自信的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1064_p", "source_sha256": "8478d8c8698937cf5308626e5afb03bf17c1665090b8aa2136fe285c03d59014", "ja": "いやちょっと待て。このみさんの弟子？\nそうなのか、真？", "zh": "欸等等，你是木实的徒弟？\n这是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1065_006mak", "source_sha256": "98fb28b7edd5865f05705b5871d66c73c2148e5b5de8919ca93849c631b7e25d", "ja": "あ、そうなんです！　ボク、セクシーは心のあり方\n次第、っていうこのみ師匠の言葉に感動して……。", "zh": "啊，正是这样！木实师父那句\n「左右性感的是自己的心态」感动了在下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1066_006mak", "source_sha256": "d0ae3d4aae94c16db203ede71846da966b57b87b2b9b496b0e7c87d39bacc465", "ja": "それで、弟子入りしたんです！　女の子っぽさも、\n心のあり方次第ですよね？　……ですよね！？", "zh": "因此在下就拜她为师了！\n女人味看的也是心态吧……？对不对！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1067_p", "source_sha256": "5b51f62638abfde149a44defc7b92cef673ddd97e9cb10eec688cca1f357c1b4", "ja": "そ、そう……だな。\nうん、間違ってないぞ、真！", "zh": "对……对啊。\n嗯，真你说的没有错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1068_012mam", "source_sha256": "68bf5fbd18fb77ffd8e55095656bba1a5b6409a0b45359e310f9e75e67f70b33", "ja": "このみんといえば、真美のせくしーライバル……。\nよかろう！　相手にとって不足ナシだよ！", "zh": "说到木木，她可是真美的性感劲敌……\n好吧！你够格当真美的对手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1069_012mam", "source_sha256": "2cc17a9c972759f081f44d5f3273ef5bc39e84a70acd158b89cc25528b7c8290", "ja": "いざ、まこちん！\n真美ピンクと、せくしー勝負だー！", "zh": "来吧，阿真！\n跟粉红战士真美用性感一决胜负吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1070_040tam", "source_sha256": "56210179907e2345963e38a3af00c7dcd721629134d441c06eaa66d30b86c679", "ja": "たまきも！\nたまきレッドもセクシー勝負したい！", "zh": "环也要！\n红色战士环也想参加性感比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1071_p", "source_sha256": "abdf1ed4f56f0ce82611fab5452b0e6d7cee702db3aa458355c6f63f7913ebfa", "ja": "いや、環、ここは真美ピンクに任せよう。\nその……真美の方が、ひとつお姉さんだしな！", "zh": "不，环，这里就交给粉红战士真美吧。\n那个……毕竟真美是比你大一岁的姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_03_1072_040tam", "source_sha256": "299b2cd4e972e417fa060ea3abea54d6e82648d2efaadc0bedda9d0375957951", "ja": "そっか、わかったよおやぶん！\nまみピンク、がんばれー！", "zh": "这样啊，环知道了，老大！\n粉红战士真美，加油──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
